      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Italian bank UniCredit's proposed €45 billion (US$49 billion) acquisition of Germany's Commerzbank is approved by the European Commission and the United States Federal Reserve.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-16:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:05Z",
      "text": "The European Central Bank gave its approval in October, and the EC grants unconditional antitrust clearance for the deal.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-16:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "The decision came from the Federal Reserve System, an independent agency of the United States government headquartered in Eccles Building.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q53536:P159",
        "wiki:2026-11-16:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:19Z",
      "text": "Inflation in the United States was 2.9% in 2024, down from 8.0% in 2022.",
      "cites": [
        "wb:FP.CPI.TOTL.ZG:US"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:27Z",
      "text": "The economy grew 2.2% in 2025, and unemployment stood at 4.2%.",
      "cites": [
        "wb:NY.GDP.MKTP.KD.ZG:US",
        "wb:SL.UEM.TOTL.ZS:US"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:37Z",
      "text": "The story was reported by Reuters.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-16:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-16T00:00:45Z",
